<%# A music track. Same as an audio post: the ```card type: player at the
    top unless the body has its own (Post#show_template_player?). Until now
    music had no template of its own and fell through to the article one,
    so a track without the card in its body had no player at all.

    A release's page will move to a `player` collection, with the track list
    and next/previous; this covers a single track until then. %>
<% if post.show_template_player? %>
  <%= render "posts/template_player", post: post %>
<% end %>

<div class="post-content">
  <%= render_post_content(post) %>
</div>
